[font_size=24]0.0.1.4 - poop patch[/font_size]
Added custom backgrounds and songs for the "Green Demon" challenge
Nerfed Flomer's challenge
Nerfed Umer
Added unique images for the "Choose an ___" text in the intermission for Predetermined and Hidden things.
Reworked Marge:
- Now, instead of having to stop your mouse as she dissapears, you have to just keep your mouse still for 0.4 seconds while she's in the red state, else you get a game over.
Fixed a bug regarding the way that clicking is checked for on the "click the bart"/"osu" thing, that would cause the game to crash.

